|---|---|
| `filter_by_tag_returns_matching_notes` | Matches 2 of 3 notes, preserves order |
| `filter_by_tag_no_match_returns_empty` | Returns empty vec when no notes have the tag |
| `filter_by_tag_exact_match_not_substring` | `"rusti"` does NOT match `"rust"` or `"rustic"` tags |

All 5 tests pass.


